Package: chronofix
Title: What the Package Does (One Line, Title Case)
Version: 0.0.9
Authors@R: 
    person("First", "Last", , "first.last@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: chronofix is an R package for Bayesian estimation of event dates
 and delay distributions using epidemiological line-list data. It is designed
 to handle commonly encountered issues with line-list datasets during outbreaks,
 including missing event dates (e.g., symptom onset, hospitalisation, or death)
 and errors in recorded dates.
